    <p class="mh">For nursing programs</p><a class="mt hero" href="/for-nursing-schools"><b>Vexcura for nursing schools</b><small>NCLEX readiness, EHR and clinical tools</small></a><a class="mt" href="/clinical-instructor-tools"><b>Clinical instructor tools</b><small>Attendance, badges, assignments</small></a><a class="mt" href="/academic-ehr-for-nursing-students"><b>Academic EHR</b><small>Epic-style charting practice</small></a><a class="mt" href="/for-nursing-schools#pricing"><b>Pricing</b><small>Every plan includes everything</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nursing-simulation-scenarios"><b>Simulation drills</b><small>Deteriorating patients, telemetry</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nursing-care-coordination"><b>Care coordination</b><small>Prioritize, delegate, the Shift sim</small></a><a class="mt" href="/virtual-nursing-simulation"><b>Virtual simulation</b><small>Live today; VR coming soon</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nursing-board-compliance"><b>Board compliance</b><small>GA, TN and AL rules</small></a><a class="mt" href="/nursing-lms-integration"><b>LMS integration</b><small>Canvas, Blackboard, D2L, Moodle</small></a><a class="mt" href="/for-nursing-schools#pilot"><b>Request a pilot</b><small>Free for one semester</small></a>
